                  "id": "article-meta",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<a href=\"/news\">← News</a>\n\nPress Release · Written by <strong>Abigail</strong> · Less than a minute",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Hudson County Motors family is gearing up for the 2nd Annual Christopher R. Friedauer Memorial Truck Show and we would like to see you there!",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Organized by GEAR JAMMER Magazine and The Holmdel PBA #239, and sponsored by Elizabeth Truck Center, this event will feature entertainment from MAIL ORDER BRIDE, and a Big Rig Light Show at dusk. Truck enthusiasts are also invited to partake in the Judged Show & Shine competition. Mark your calendar and come together for a day of fun, appreciation, and celebration of the trucking community!",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>Show a Truck: $30; Spectators: $20 per carload</strong>",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>Bell Works, 101 Crawfords Corner Rd. Holmdel, N.J.</strong>",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>May 18, 2024 – Rain or shine!</strong>",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Proceeds from the show will be donated to three worthy causes: The Ricky Silvani Foundation for suicide prevention, the Holmdel PBA #239 for their local charitable efforts, and The Christopher R. Friedauer Memorial Fund for Chris’ children.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
